mentation</strong> — engineering drawing, engineering economics, project planning/scheduling/management, professional ethics, and NEC\'s regulatory framework</li></ol><p><strong>Always check the current official NEC Electronics, Communication and Automation Engineering syllabus PDF at nec.gov.np before your exam</strong> — branch syllabi are reviewed periodically and this page will be updated to match, but the official NEC notice is the authoritative source for exact topic weightage.</p>',
