    'exam_pattern' => 'Multi-phase: application screening + initial medical check, Physical Endurance Evaluation Test (PEET) + detailed medical check, written exam (General Knowledge, Nepali, English, Mathematics, Police Professional Awareness) plus language/aptitude tests for some ranks, further medical evaluation, and a final interview with group discussion.',
